You guard against melee damage with a sweep of your hand. So long as you can use Gestures (Requires two free or mindstar-equipped hands), you deflect up to [9, 12, 14, 16, 17 (TL1-5; STR 100; CUN 100; PP 100)] damage ([23%, 30%, 35%, 38%, 41% (TL1-5)] of your best free hand melee damage) from up to [0.0, 0.6, 1.3, 1.8, 2.3 (STR 10-100; CUN 10-100; PP 10-100)] melee attack(s) each turn (based on your cunning). Deflected attacks cannot be crits.

If Gesture of Pain is active, you also have a [4.5%, 5.9%, 6.9%, 7.8%, 8.5% (TL1-5)] chance to counterattack.
